  "P(X ≤ {0}) 정확한 값":["P(X ≤ {0}) exact value", "P(X ≤ {0}) valor exacto", "P(X ≤ {0}) valeur exacte", "P(X ≤ {0}) exakter Wert", "P(X ≤ {0}) 正確な値"],
