  actions:[['a100','표본평균 100개 더하기'],['a1000','표본평균 1000개 더하기'],['clr','처음부터']],
  act:function(k){ if(k==='clr') reset(); else add(this.p,k==='a100'?100:1000); },
  cols:[{k:'n',l:'n',d:0},{k:'cnt',l:'표본평균의 개수',d:0},{k:'m',l:'표본평균들의 평균',d:4},{k:'sd',l:'표본평균들의 표준편차',d:4},{k:'th',l:'σ/√n',d:4}], gx:'n', gy:'sd', fit:false,
  reset:function(){ reset(); }, change:function(id){ if(id==='pop'||id==='n') reset(); },
